**STEP 0 verdict: PASS.** **6 EAPOL frames in 106 seconds** -- one authentication at t=0 and then
**nothing at all** for the remaining 105 seconds. This is the control the whole case rests on: it
fixes the number the ON legs have to beat, and it proves the supplicant tool itself does not
generate periodic traffic.

